(7601765, 1227791, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image - evokes a sense of distance and space - very appealing.</td>', 'Wonderful image - evokes a sense of distance and space - very appealing.', '2018-11-09 11:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601767, 1228206, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a school of thought that says sun rises and sunsets are "easy" - it isn''t true and while most images of sunsets/rises are pedestrian, this image goes well beyond "average" into that rarest of ratings, perfection. <br/>Absolutely stunning - I can''t say enough positive things. It deserves to win hands down and there is some stiff competition in this challenge.</td>', 'There is a school of thought that says sun rises and sunsets are "easy" - it isn''t true and while most images of sunsets/rises are pedestrian, this image goes well beyond "average" into that rarest of ratings, perfection. Absolutely stunning - I can''t say enough positive things. It deserves to win hands down and there is some stiff competition in this challenge.', '2018-11-09 11:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601768, 1228157, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely amazing - National Geographic perfection and if I were the author, I would enter it into the NG photo contest - its that good.</td>', 'This is absolutely amazing - National Geographic perfection and if I were the author, I would enter it into the NG photo contest - its that good.', '2018-11-09 11:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601771, 1227879, 56502, '<td valign="top">Amazing light and colors!</td>', 'Amazing light and colors!', '2018-11-09 11:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601800, 1228180, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is near perfect. The combination of muted colors, the near 3D effect, the subtle lighting on the lowland veld - beautiful. I think a crop to the top of the mountain would improve this image. Still, a beautiful image.</td>', 'This is near perfect. The combination of muted colors, the near 3D effect, the subtle lighting on the lowland veld - beautiful. I think a crop to the top of the mountain would improve this image. Still, a beautiful image.', '2018-11-09 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601801, 1228067, 101256, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image. I think a little less contrast so you could see some details on the know covered trees would help, but still - great image.</td>', 'A wonderful image. I think a little less contrast so you could see some details on the know covered trees would help, but still - great image.', '2018-11-09 15:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601803, 1228193, 101256, '<td valign="top">Almost too perfect - the cliff face eposures of different levels of time and space - wonderful. Really can''t say enough positive things about this - well done.</td>', 'Almost too perfect - the cliff face eposures of different levels of time and space - wonderful. Really can''t say enough positive things about this - well done.', '2018-11-09 15:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601804, 1227616, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yellowstone is a wonder land - I''ve been there several times both fly fishing the Yellowstone and just wandering around. In fact, I think I''ve been where this image was taken. Anyway, great capture - gives a true flavor of the park.</td>', 'Yellowstone is a wonder land - I''ve been there several times both fly fishing the Yellowstone and just wandering around. In fact, I think I''ve been where this image was taken. Anyway, great capture - gives a true flavor of the park.', '2018-11-09 15:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601805, 1227889, 101256, '<td valign="top">A really cool place to visit - been there several times over the years. This captures the nature of the place - well done.</td>', 'A really cool place to visit - been there several times over the years. This captures the nature of the place - well done.', '2018-11-09 15:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601806, 1227879, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of "wow" factor - the combination of light and shadow coupled with a significant sense of distance - a great capture - worthy of a magazine layout.</td>', 'This image has a lot of "wow" factor - the combination of light and shadow coupled with a significant sense of distance - a great capture - worthy of a magazine layout.', '2018-11-09 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7601904, 1227791, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  The differing colors and textures are beautiful.</td>', 'I love this picture.  The differing colors and textures are beautiful.', '2018-11-10 09:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7602019, 1227779, 30861, '<td valign="top">Of course, Lobos isn''t a National Park or Seashore, Paul, but who''s checking? :-)</td>', 'Of course, Lobos isn''t a National Park or Seashore, Paul, but who''s checking? :-)', '2018-11-11 00:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7602116, 1228075, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a wild scene! The mountain in the back seems to be wearing several layers of cloud hats.</td>', 'What a wild scene! The mountain in the back seems to be wearing several layers of cloud hats.', '2018-11-11 20:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7602118, 1228208, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love that bit of light. I''m imagining it''s morning, and the whole scene is about to be lit up.</td>', 'Love that bit of light. I''m imagining it''s morning, and the whole scene is about to be lit up.', '2018-11-11 20:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7602119, 1228061, 65234, '<td valign="top">So jealous! This must have been remarkable to see in person. Love mama''s watchfulness.</td>', 'So jealous! This must have been remarkable to see in person. Love mama''s watchfulness.', '2018-11-11 20:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7602121, 1228193, 65234, '<td valign="top">So the blues look a little oversaturated on my screen, but I love them anyway. The color palette here is just lovely.</td>', 'So the blues look a little oversaturated on my screen, but I love them anyway. The color palette here is just lovely.', '2018-11-11 20:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7602122, 1227889, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool place! A nicely lit tunnel and some alien ponds, besides.</td>', 'Cool place! A nicely lit tunnel and some alien ponds, besides.', '2018-11-11 20:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7602123, 1228184, 65234, '<td valign="top">I imagine I hear deafening roaring from all those waterfalls.</td>', 'I imagine I hear deafening roaring from all those waterfalls.', '2018-11-11 20:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
