(7602126, 1227791, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the fog in the "hollers." The blue of the mountains and the greens of the trees are very soothing.</td>', 'Love the fog in the "hollers." The blue of the mountains and the greens of the trees are very soothing.', '2018-11-11 20:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
