(7602186, 1228209, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is lovely - I really enjoyed viewing it during the voting period. A lovely take on the challenge.  If I had managed to get a photo of the wild flower meadows in Swaledale that I was pleased enough with, I would have entered that.  This speaks of the wonders of nature, and of conservation of our special areas of nature, bio diversity and countryside.</td>', 'This is lovely - I really enjoyed viewing it during the voting period. A lovely take on the challenge.  If I had managed to get a photo of the wild flower meadows in Swaledale that I was pleased enough with, I would have entered that.  This speaks of the wonders of nature, and of conservation of our special areas of nature, bio diversity and countryside.', '2018-11-12 06:15:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7602195, 1228199, 100831, '<td valign="top">Cute pic and very badlands... it was a 7 from me, I was thinking it would finish higher.</td>', 'Cute pic and very badlands... it was a 7 from me, I was thinking it would finish higher.', '2018-11-12 08:36:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7602197, 1228046, 16148, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this a while.  The gull exiting the top right corner and the hand holding a treat follows.  It''s not just any hand but of someone who has seen it all, seen things that happen to us all.  Such a beautiful picture of our better angels.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this a while.  The gull exiting the top right corner and the hand holding a treat follows.  It''s not just any hand but of someone who has seen it all, seen things that happen to us all.  Such a beautiful picture of our better angels.', '2018-11-12 08:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7602205, 1228075, 181335, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for your vote! I was one of the team member of drone photographer that has been wake up at 2.30am to wait for the sunlight. It''s the first morning we arrived Bromo National park, As there were many trucks and landRover travelling to the spots.we have to walk more than a hour to this viewing point.we are lucky to view the mountain in the back were having a few layers of cloud hats.I finally change my lens to 24-105mm Zoom.</td>', 'Thanks a lot for your vote! I was one of the team member of drone photographer that has been wake up at 2.30am to wait for the sunlight. It''s the first morning we arrived Bromo National park, As there were many trucks and landRover travelling to the spots.we have to walk more than a hour to this viewing point.we are lucky to view the mountain in the back were having a few layers of cloud hats.I finally change my lens to 24-105mm Zoom.', '2018-11-12 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 0),
